{
  "name": "hearth",
  "for": "Food, hospitality, neighbourhood retail — restaurants, cafés, bakeries, salons, boutiques, florists.",
  "voice": "Warm, handmade, local. Cream base, terracotta primary, olive accent, soft corners, hours and location up front.",
  "move": "A tinted, dotted surface band behind the hero instead of a full-bleed photo — so a bad photo can never wreck the first screen.",
  "fonts": {
